<title>USA: Stark is Northwest Cargo strategic planner.</title>
<headline>Stark is Northwest Cargo strategic planner.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northwest Airlines said it has named Peter Stark director of strategic planning for the airline's cargo division.</p>
<p>Stark has been with Northwest since 1976 and was most recently regional cargo sales manager in Los Angeles, the airline said.</p>
<p>Stark succeeds Robert Isom, who left the airline to pursue other opportunities.</p>
